  "description": "YIGKUV crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 O12 Yb4,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 5 O neighbors; Yb1C (Yb) has 5 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 5 O neighbors; Yb1B (Yb) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.489-3.489 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.96-104.10°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132O12Yb4·C6H14.",
